  "definition": "Normal hit chance uses attacker AV plus attack accuracy modifier against defender DV + AC. hit_rating = (AV + acc_mod)^2 / 140; hit_chance = 100 - (DV + AC)^2 / hit_rating, clamped 10..99. Roll genrdn(1,100); hit when roll < hit_chance. Backstab uses AV-DV path instead.",
  "inputs": [
    "AV",
    "DV",
    "AC",
    "acc_mod",
    "attack_type"
  ],
  "outputs": [
    "hit_chance",
    "miss_or_continue"
  ],
